sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Bus as EventBus
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant BP as Backpressure
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant Stream as Redis Stream
    participant PubSub as Redis Pub/Sub

    App->>Bus: publish("orders.created", data)
    Bus->>MW: before_publish(event)
    MW-->>Bus: event (possibly transformed)
    Bus->>BP: acquire semaphore
    BP-->>Bus: OK (or raise BackpressureError)
    Bus->>CB: ensure_closed()
    CB-->>Bus: OK (or raise CircuitOpenError)
    Bus->>Stream: XADD eventbus:stream:orders.created
    Stream-->>Bus: message ID "1678886400000-0"
    Bus->>PubSub: PUBLISH eventbus:channel:orders.created
    Note over PubSub: Best-effort — failure here<br/>is non-fatal
    PubSub-->>Bus: subscriber count
    Bus->>BP: release semaphore
    Bus->>MW: after_publish(event, stream_id)
    Bus-->>App: "1678886400000-0"
